   "definition_quote": "In the heavy-tailed multi-armed bandit problem (HTMAB), a learner is faced with K arms repeatedly for T rounds. Every time an action i in [K] is selected, a reward X is sampled from the distribution nu_i satisfying E[|X|^{1+eps}] <= u, for some eps in (0,1] and u in R+."
